{"version":1,"content":"<p>黃婧靈（波波）與陳熙蕊今日（2日）出席無綫節目挑戰打乒乓球爭取球隊一員，波波表示喜歡球類運動，但甚少接觸乒乓球，她為節目事前找來乒乓球教練跟她練習：「唔知出來效果點，盡咗力。</p><p>（你有冇信心入隊？</p><p>）對於隊長陳展鵬，我冇信心，好驚，佢都有叫我放鬆</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-02T12:01:17.662458+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":122,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-02T11:36:35+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-02T11:58:18.266659+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-02T11:58:18.266659+00:00","content_hash":"d012f579c00521b93d1f89261506a59fb5b53d6be494be2d7fc86a4adec4a1a7","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}